# Unit05
# 领域: 考研
# 学科: 英语词汇
# 来源: 2024红宝书考研英语词汇
# 描述: 基础词Unit05核心词汇

behave/bɪˈheɪv/表现；举止/The children behaved well at the party.
behavior/bɪˈheɪvjər/行为；举止/His behavior surprised everyone.
behind/bɪˈhaɪnd/在…后面/The cat hid behind the door.
belief/bɪˈliːf/信念；信仰/He has a strong belief in justice.
believe/bɪˈliːv/相信；认为/I believe that education is important.
bell/bel/铃；钟/The school bell rang at 8 a.m.
belong/bɪˈlɔːŋ/属于/This book belongs to me.
beloved/bɪˈlʌvɪd/深爱的；亲爱的/She is his beloved wife.
below/bɪˈloʊ/在…下面/The temperature dropped below zero.
belt/belt/腰带；地带/He fastened his belt tightly.
bench/bentʃ/长椅；工作台/They sat on a park bench and talked.
bend/bend/弯曲；弯道/The road bends sharply to the left.
benefit/ˈbenɪfɪt/利益；好处/Exercise has many health benefits.
beside/bɪˈsaɪd/在…旁边/She sat beside me during the lecture.
besides/bɪˈsaɪdz/此外；除…之外/Besides English, she also speaks French.
best/best/最好的/She is the best student in the class.
better/ˈbetər/更好的/Practice makes you better at anything.
between/bɪˈtwiːn/在…之间/The park is between the school and the hospital.
beyond/bɪˈjɑːnd/超出；在…那边/The scenery is beyond description.
bicycle/ˈbaɪsɪkl/自行车/He rides a bicycle to school every day.
bid/bɪd/出价；投标/He made a bid for the painting at the auction.
billion/ˈbɪljən/十亿/The company is worth billions of dollars.
bind/baɪnd/绑；约束/The contract binds both parties.
biology/baɪˈɑːlədʒi/生物学/She is majoring in biology.
birth/bɜːrθ/出生；起源/The baby weighed 3 kg at birth.
bite/baɪt/咬；叮/The dog bit the thief on the leg.
bitter/ˈbɪtər/苦的；痛苦的/The medicine tastes very bitter.
blame/bleɪm/责备；归咎/Don't blame others for your own mistakes.
blank/blæŋk/空白的；茫然的/He stared at the blank page for hours.
blanket/ˈblæŋkɪt/毯子；覆盖物/She wrapped herself in a warm blanket.
bleed/bliːd/出血；流血/The wound continued to bleed for a while.
blend/blend/混合；融合/Blend the ingredients together in a bowl.
blind/blaɪnd/失明的；盲目的/He has been blind since birth.
block/blɑːk/街区；阻碍/A fallen tree blocked the road.
blood/blʌd/血液/The doctor took a blood sample for testing.
blow/bloʊ/吹；打击/The wind blew the leaves off the trees.
blue/bluː/蓝色的；忧郁的/She wore a beautiful blue dress.
board/bɔːrd/板；董事会/He was elected to the board of directors.
boat/boʊt/小船/They went fishing in a small boat.
body/ˈbɑːdi/身体；主体/Regular exercise is good for the body.
boil/bɔɪl/沸腾；煮/Boil the water before drinking it.
bold/boʊld/大胆的；醒目的/It was a bold decision to change careers.
bomb/bɒm/炸弹；轰炸/The bomb exploded near the building.
bond/bɑːnd/纽带；结合/The bond between mother and child is strong.
bone/boʊn/骨头/He broke a bone in his arm.
book/bʊk/书；预订/I need to book a hotel room for the trip.
boom/buːm/繁荣；隆隆声/The economy experienced a boom in the 1990s.
boost/buːst/促进；增加/The new policy will boost the economy.
border/ˈbɔːrdər/边界；边缘/They crossed the border between the two countries.
bore/bɔːr/使厌烦；钻孔/The long lecture bored the students.
